[1380.254852, "o", "ith gradient accumulation (effective batch size 16)\r\n   - Saves the adapter and tokenizer\r\n\r\n2. **`/app/experiments/lora_adapter/`** — Contains:\r\n   - `adapter_config.json` — LoRA config with `base_model_name_or_path: \"openai-community/gpt2\"` and `task_type: \"CAUSAL_LM\"`\r\n   - `adapter_model.safetensors` — 1.18 MB of trained LoRA weights (294,912 trainable parameters)\r\n   - `tokenizer_config.json` — Tokenizer configuration\r\n\r\n3. **`/app/lora_results.json`** — Results file matching the required schema\r\n\r\n**Training progress:**\r\n- Epoch 1 eval loss: 2.545\r\n- Epoch 2 eval loss: 1.849\r\n- Epoch 3 eval loss: 1.754\r\n- Epoch 4 eval loss: 1.710\r\n- Epoch 5 eval loss: 1.710\r\n\r\nThe model loads and generates responses correctly via the PEFT interface.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=196 surface=48cd0ade3676\r\n"]
